---
import BaseLayout from '../shared/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Asset Test" project="assets">
  <h1>🎨 Chassis Assets - Centralized Asset Test</h1>

  <p>This page tests the centralized asset approach where all projects reference <code>chassis-ui.com/static</code></p>

  <h2>Asset References Test</h2>

  <div style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3>CSS Test</h3>
    <p>If you see proper styling, the CSS is loading from the centralized location.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3>Icon Test</h3>
    <p>Favicon should load from centralized assets.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3>Navigation Test</h3>
    <p>Navigation above should work between all projects.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>How It Works</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Development:</strong> Uses <code>/shared/*</code> via symbolic links</li>
    <li><strong>Production:</strong> Uses <code>https://chassis-ui.com/static/*</code></li>
    <li><strong>Result:</strong> All projects share the same assets from one location</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Asset URLs in Production</h3>
  <pre style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; overflow-x: auto;">
chassis-ui.com/static/css/chassis.css
chassis-ui.com/static/css/chassis-icons.css
chassis-ui.com/static/fonts/inter.woff2
chassis-ui.com/static/icons/favicon.svg
chassis-ui.com/static/images/logo.svg</pre>

  <h3>Projects Using These Assets</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>chassis-ui.com</code> (main docs)</li>
    <li><code>chassis-ui.com/chassis-assets</code> (this site)</li>
    <li><code>chassis-ui.com/chassis-css</code> (CSS framework docs)</li>
    <li><code>chassis-ui.com/chassis-tokens</code> (design tokens docs)</li>
  </ul>

  <div style="background: #e7f3ff; border: 1px solid #0066cc; padding: 1rem; margin: 2rem 0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h4>✅ Benefits of This Approach</h4>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Single Source:</strong> Update assets once, all projects benefit</li>
      <li><strong>No Duplication:</strong> Assets served from one location</li>
      <li><strong>Cache Efficiency:</strong> Same assets cached across all projects</li>
      <li><strong>Atomic Updates:</strong> Deploy assets once, all sites update</li>
      <li><strong>Independent Deployments:</strong> Projects can still deploy separately</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
